WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.289 --> 00:00:04.349
Tourists are popular targets for pickpockets.

2
00:00:04.769 --> 00:00:08.010
The existence of pickpockets in a crowded tourist spot

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.119
is a threat to the people gathered there.

4
00:00:10.659 --> 00:00:14.869
That threat applies to everyone in the vicinity, even other pickpockets,

5
00:00:15.289 --> 00:00:19.159
if you are in the vicinity, and a pickpocket has identified you as a target.

6
00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.200
You are facing a threat actor

7
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.920
whether you know it or not,

8
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.719
the approach and technique taken by the pickpocket is their threat vector.

9
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.439
Let's say the pickpocket chooses you as a target

10
00:00:34.569 --> 00:00:38.619
because they see that it will be easier or more profitable to steal from you.

11
00:00:39.189 --> 00:00:43.119
Maybe you are distracted have jewelry that is easy to snatch

12
00:00:43.169 --> 00:00:46.310
or appear weak and less likely to put up a struggle.

13
00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:50.380
In other words, you appear more vulnerable than the other tourists

14
00:00:50.529 --> 00:00:54.950
and the pickpocket feels that they can exploit that vulnerability or weakness.